	)
	(text "Always follow NEC guidelines for applying low-voltage fuses. Generally,\nthe MINIMUM fuse size should be based on 125% of the circuits full load\ncurrent. Time-delay fuses should be used for inductive loads."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.098 191.516 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d73c2721-441b-4291-aa9f-e0e13223e765")
	)
	(text "The characteristic impedance of UTP CAT5, CAT6\nis around 100ohm. With 120ohm termination in both\nsides, may get good results with these cables\n(Must be within 20%)."
